  "body": "## Summary\n- adds Roserpina-authoritative absolute caps: order €1, market €2, event €2, absolute drawdown €10\n- applies BACK stake / LAY liability with exact-threshold tolerance and the most restrictive applicable cap\n- rejects missing, conflicting, invalid or non-string side before dedupe, reservation or transport\n- serializes signal/auto-trade admission and cap reload with the same in-process risk lock\n- routes protective CASHOUT/CASHOUT_ALL through the existing gates without waiting for entry-order network I/O\n- retains matched-position exposure until settlement and aggregates canonical market/event identities\n- latches runtime lockdown when auto-trade reaches the absolute drawdown threshold\n- converts missing/invalid settlement auto-trade sides into a fail-closed MM decision\n- keeps P06 per-strategy DEFERRED; no strategy_ref, DEFAULT bucket or parallel MM introduced\n\n## Safety\n- LIVE remains OFF; no real Betfair/Telegram calls were made\n- Telegram remains suspended; touched Telegram paths only enforce fail-closed compatibility and preserve protective cashout\n- mandatory persisted absolute-cap keys that are blank/corrupt remain configured-invalid and deny order admission\n- PR26/27/28/28-b/28-c risk-stop and persistence behavior preserved\n- cross-process durable reservation remains PR29; this slice prevents same-controller races without pretending PR29 is complete\n\n## Tests\n- cycle-6 RED evidence: 7 failures reproducing the six-owner-approved findings on parent `5cc249b`\n- cycle-6 GREEN evidence: 7 passed\n- affected PR28-d/lifecycle/settlement/recovery/live-sim regression: 334 passed\n- complete repository suite: 7323 passed, 15 skipped, 1 historical xfail, 0 failed\n- core/invariant selection: 61 passed\n- 89 guardrail JSON files validated\n- full-diff autonomy check: PASS; no problems, dependencies, secrets, owner-manual files or new money-path callers\n- py_compile, merge-marker scan, scope equality and git diff --check passed\n\n## Scope\n22 files, exactly matching `issue461-pr28d-absolute-caps`.\nCycle 6 is the explicit one-time owner override limited to the six classified safety/real-money findings. It changes four already-scoped files and does not create a precedent or alter the global five-cycle policy.\n\n## Deferred\nP06 max exposure per strategy remains DEFERRED / NOT IMPLEMENTED pending future owner-defined MCP strategy management.",
